        "Content": "Lands Chapel Road, Stradbally, Co. Waterford\r\n\r\n c. 14.88ha - c. 36.76 acres\r\n\r\nFor Sale by Live Virtual Online & Public Auction\r\n\r\nWednesday 14th of October 2026 AtWilsons Auctions, Kingswood Interchange, Naas Road, Dublin 22\r\n\r\nExcellent Potential \r\n\r\nLocation Stradbally 500m, Dungarvan 14km, Waterford 33km, Tramore 36km \r\n\r\nThe lands are located on Chapel Road 600m north of the village of Stradbally. Population (2016) 438. Stradbally is a picturesque village located in Co Waterford. Situated on the stunning Copper Coast, it offers beautiful coastal scenery and access to some of Ireland's most breathtaking landscapes. The village itself has a quaint charm, with traditional Irish architecture and a welcoming atmosphere. The town has a primary school, various shops, pubs, and sporting clubs. The sought after town of Dungarvan is 14km. Waterford city is within easy reach, where most animated and transport links are to be found. Stradbally and Ballyvooney Cove on the coast are a short walk from the village. \r\n\r\nDescription Folio WD2526\r\n\r\nThe lands are contained within folio WD2526 and amount to c. 14.88ha - c. 36.76 acres. The subject lands are in one irregular shaped block on either side of the public road. They are laid out in manageable divisions with mature boundaries. The lands all in grass are excellent quality suited to all types of the farming. Centrally located is a modern agricultural building and yard. There is good road frontage. \r\n\r\nPart of the lands are within the town boundary and are currently zoned mixed/general/community services/facilities use.\r\n\r\nWe note planning has been approved on the lands for a mast with a large telecommunications company please enquire for further information \r\n\r\nIdeal location for a one or more houses or subject to the necessary planning. \r\n\r\nThe lands are being sold as seen and not subject to planning. \r\n\r\nCoordinates 52.134406, -7.464468\r\n\r\nViewing By Appointment Only\r\n\r\nSolicitor Gabriel Motea Byrne Wallace Shields LLP 88 Harcourt Street, Dublin 2,\r\n\r\nVAT Refer to legal contracts."
